# Reports

## Purpose

This folder contains investigation reports documenting the findings and conclusions of the Windows security monitoring and threat detection project.

## Report Contents

Investigation reports may include:

- Investigation objectives and scope.
- Windows security events analysed.
- Evidence collected.
- Potentially suspicious activities identified.
- Detection rules and testing results.
- Investigation findings and conclusions.
- Recommendations and limitations.

## Reporting Standards

- Findings must be supported by documented evidence.
- Observations must be distinguished from assumptions.
- Detection results must accurately reflect testing.
- Limitations must be clearly documented.
- Recommendations should be relevant to the investigation findings.

## Current Status

The final investigation report will be produced after practical monitoring, evidence collection and detection testing have been completed.
